          "text": "Témoignages: MARSEILLE (13) 14.12.2022 questionnaire technique-R.pdf temoin video PXL_20221214_063322789.mp4",
          "text_sha256": "e78e5751000d6945868c3113c820dbff41de97b77a5dbae47ca0b5b3c1d68001"
